Z||000000||The Fieromaster||06-05-2001||04:45 PM||||I am changing my Fiero GT (85 - fastback converted) to have black and yellow interior rather than the purple that it is... There was way to much purple inside for me!  I am wondering for those of you who have placed the carpet up front (under the hood) what tricks are there to installing it?  What glue did you use?  I saw some REALLY nicly done Fiero's at Carlisle this year... All help is appreciated.. Thanks in advance!<P>------------------<BR>The Fieromaster<BR>Craig Gibson<BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000||||reg||5
