Z||000002||sluppy123||06-05-2001||06:23 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1711832&a=11172186&p=40189805&Sequence=0"> <BR>Here's a pic of mine. I used two pieces of carpet, started in the center and worked my way out. I used some spray on glue and silicon adhesive. It's not a hard job just takes a little time.<P>------------------<BR>-Brian, Toolmaker<BR>Lincoln, NE<BR>87' GT-Galaxy silver mettalic, Eibach springs, RSM side scoops, Mr Mikes leather, 70hp NOS, 17" Mille Miglia's, and lots more.<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=247832&a=12781563&p=48213929&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||1
